abstract: >
  HRMS-Predict is a free, open-source, locally-installable ensemble platform
  for in silico Phase I and Phase II metabolite prediction. It combines SyGMa,
  SMARTCyp, BioTransformer, MetaTrans, and Meta-Predictor into a single
  pipeline with HRMS-grade exact mass annotation, enzyme-annotated soft-spot
  visualisation, and one-click LC-HRMS target list export.
  Validated against 1,245 substrates in MetXBioDB (63.0% pooled recall,
  F1=0.305 at rank 10) and a ten-compound reference panel (93% recall).
  RRID:SCR_028518.
